% SLIDE 20. 50-54. Use one existing failed test's artifacts if available.
### A Failure Has a Stage
[compile] @(70,155) {$note} **Compiler failure:** inspect `.compile.log`, the source line, and the AST when available. Check parser and semantic behavior first.
...
[assembly] @(70,280) {$note} **Assembly failure:** inspect `.wat` and `.assemble.log`. Look for undeclared locals, stack values, wrong types, and malformed control structure.
...
[run] @(70,405) {$note} **Runtime mismatch:** inspect calls and expected values in `tests/manifest.json`, then emitted evaluation order, bindings, and branch targets.
...
[timeout] @(70,555) {$note, color=focus} **Timeout:** check condition placement, state updates, and continue targets. A loop must make progress and recheck its condition.
